\newlabel{tab:breakout_cohort}{{4}{17}{Top 5 players by posterior mean peak OBPM per entry cohort. P($>$2), P($>$3), P($>$4) are posterior probabilities that peak OBPM exceeds the threshold; empirically, 19\% of players peaked above OBPM\,$=$\,2, 12\% above OBPM\,$=$\,3, and 7\% above OBPM\,$=$\,4 (career peak per player). Yrs to Peak is the posterior mean OBPM peak age minus last observed age (0.0 = already at peak).\relax }{table.caption.8}{}}
