\newlabel{fig:archetype_slopes}{{17}{33}{Posterior mean GP first derivative before (left) and after (right) the peak age, by archetype and metric. Points show the mean over posterior draws; intervals are 80\% credible intervals. Slopes are in latent-space units per year; positive post-peak values indicate skill-based metrics that continue growing or plateau after the nominal peak.\relax }{figure.caption.23}{}}
\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {19}{\ignorespaces Posterior estimates of peak value by player (top) and the first two PCA loadings of the peak-value matrix (bottom). The same athleticism/skill grouping is reflected here, confirming that athleticism-reliant metrics not only peak earlier but also reach lower absolute ceilings relative to skill-based metrics.\relax }}{33}{figure.caption.25}\protected@file@percent }
