\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {18}{\ignorespaces Career arc asymmetry by archetype and metric: pre-peak slope divided by the absolute post-peak slope. The dashed line at 1 marks symmetric careers. Ratios above 1 indicate faster decline than ascent (common for athleticism metrics); ratios below 1 indicate faster ascent than decline (common for skill-acquisition metrics such as three-point shooting and playmaking).\relax }}{34}{figure.caption.24}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:archetype_slope_ratio}{{18}{34}{Career arc asymmetry by archetype and metric: pre-peak slope divided by the absolute post-peak slope. The dashed line at 1 marks symmetric careers. Ratios above 1 indicate faster decline than ascent (common for athleticism metrics); ratios below 1 indicate faster ascent than decline (common for skill-acquisition metrics such as three-point shooting and playmaking).\relax }{figure.caption.24}{}}
