\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {24}{\ignorespaces Posterior-mean curvature energy share by metric and HSGP basis (rows sum to 1). Each cell reports the fraction of metric $k$'s total curvature energy $\DOTSB \sum@ \slimits@ _l G_{k,ll}$ carried by basis $l$; metrics are ordered by their basis-1 share. Metrics concentrated on basis 1 bend once, broadly, over the career; metrics with mass on higher bases exhibit sharper or asymmetric bending.\relax }}{62}{figure.caption.69}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:concave_loadings_heatmap}{{24}{62}{Posterior-mean curvature energy share by metric and HSGP basis (rows sum to 1). Each cell reports the fraction of metric $k$'s total curvature energy $\sum _l G_{k,ll}$ carried by basis $l$; metrics are ordered by their basis-1 share. Metrics concentrated on basis 1 bend once, broadly, over the career; metrics with mass on higher bases exhibit sharper or asymmetric bending.\relax }{figure.caption.69}{}}
